==History==
2024
*The P.E.K.K.A's Evolution was made available on 30/8/2024, before its release date, as an unintended glitch. Supercell fixed this glitch with a maintenance break.
*The P.E.K.K.A's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 2/9/2024, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/9/2024)|September 2024 Update]].
*On 8/10/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/10/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved P.E.K.K.A's healing per KO to 10% (from 12.5%).
*On 14/11/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/11/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved P.E.K.K.A'S healing per KO to 7.5% (from 10%).
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]], added a sound effect to the Evolved P.E.K.K.A after death.
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], made it so that Evolved P.E.K.K.A's healing per KO would be based on the target's hitpoints instead of healing the same amount from all troops.
*On 30/1/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (30/1/2025)|maintenance break]], corrected the Evolved P.E.K.K.A's healing per KO value.
*On 4/2/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved P.E.K.K.A's range to 1.2 tiles (from 1.6 tiles), now classified as Melee: Medium.
*On 5/5/2025, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/5/2025)|May 2025 Update]], increased the Evolved P.E.K.K.A.'s healing per small unit by 13%, healing per medium unit by 8%, and healing per large unit by 2%.
2026

* On 2/2/2026, increased the Evolved P.E.K.K.A.'s Heal per Kill from all forms by 5%.
* On 6/7/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/3/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Evolved P.E.K.K.A's damage by 3%

==Trivia==
*P.E.K.K.A's name derives from the Finnish name for "''Peter''", which in turn comes from the Greek name "''Petros''", meaning stone.
*The acronym for P.E.K.K.A doesn't officially stand for anything in particular originally. Supercell held a Facebook contest on 22 August 2012 to see who could come up with the best written-out name for P.E.K.K.A as judged by the number of likes the comment received. The name "''Perfectly Enraged Knight Killer of Assassins''" was the winner. The person who submitted the acronym was called Víctor in the [https://www.facebook.com/ClashofClans/photos/478339952190333 Facebook announcement].
*The P.E.K.K.A's Evolution is tied with the [[Royal Recruits/Evolution|Royal Recruits]] and [[Mega Knight/Evolution|Mega Knight]] for the most expensive [[:Category:1-Cycles Evolutions|1-Cycle]] [[Card Evolution|Evolution]], costing 7 [[Elixir]]. They are also the most expensive Evolution overall.
*Among all evolved [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] with overheal hitpoints, the Evolved P.E.K.K.A has the highest overheal hitpoints in the game, with 8,212 hitpoints at Level 15.
*The P.E.K.K.A is 1 of 2 evolved troops that has been featured under the [[Ruler Ability#Clash Melee|Clash Melee]] [[Ruler Ability|ruler ability]], the other being Mega Knight.
*P.E.K.K.A's gender has been confirmed as female, as one of the Loading Screen Hints in Clash of Clans states, ''"The armor on P.E.K.K.A is so heavy that Spring Traps don't affect her"'', and also several videos from the official YouTube. In Clash Royale, the P.E.K.K.A. Protector [[Battle Banners|Decoration]]'s description says "''No one messes with her butterfly''".
**However, in the Arabic, Persian, and Finnish language setting of the game, the P.E.K.K.A is referred to as male, according to her card description.
*According to a Clash-A-Rama comic [https://clasharama.fandom.com/wiki/Clash-A-Rama!_Comic_Strips?file=BRING-YOUR-CHILD-TO-WORK-DAY_Final.jpg strip], the [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.|Mini P.E.K.K.A]] is the P.E.K.K.A's child.
*In the card's description, the "''Floats like a butterfly, stings like a bee.''" line is a reference to a quote mentioned by [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Muhammad_Ali Muhammad Ali].
*When deployed, the Evolved P.E.K.K.A will briefly say ''"Butterfly"'' in a deep robotic voice.
**The P.E.K.K.A is 1 of 9 evolved troops that speak distinct words when on the field, the others being [[Bomber/Evolution|Bomber]], [[Wizard/Evolution|Wizard]], [[Goblin Cage/Evolution|Goblin Brawler]], [[Witch/Evolution|Witch]], [[Hunter/Evolution|Hunter]], [[Executioner/Evolution|Executioner]], Mega Knight, and [[Lumberjack/Evolution|Lumberjack]].
*The P.E.K.K.A's Evolution is the subject of 2 [[Emotes]].
*The P.E.K.K.A's Evolution has had balance changes that were planned for it but were not added to the game. More specifically:
**The initial balance change for Evolved P.E.K.K.A on the [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/10/2024)|8/10/2024 balance changes]] was a healing per KO decrease to 11% (from 12.5%), but it was lowered to 10% [https://royaleapi.com/blog/season-64-balance-wip last minute].
**The initial balance change for Evolved P.E.K.K.A on the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/5/2025)|May 2025 Update]] was a 13% healing per medium unit KO, and a 13% healing per large unit KO, but the healing per medium unit KO lowered to 8% and the healing per large unit KO lowered to 2% [https://royaleapi.com/blog/season-71-balance-wip-may-2025 last minute].
*Before the P.E.K.K.A's Evolution card was released, the Evolved P.E.K.K.A's healing per KO was increased to 12.5% (from 10%).

